        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra sighs. â€œEvery once in a while, the magic on Etheria will start to... malfunction. It affects all of the princesses with runestones, especially Shera. It makes them... tired. It hasnâ€™t happened in years, though.â€&lt;br /&gt;----&lt;br /&gt;OR: On the 20th anniversary of Horde Primes defeat, Etheria's magic malfunctions and opens up a portal to a few months before Horde Prime showed up.&lt;br /&gt;----&lt;br /&gt;OR: Catra is jealous of herself.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
